<view class="coupons-page"><view class="wallet-title"><view>每一份好礼，</view><view>都在这里。</view></view><view class="wallet-subtitle">全商城商品通用 · 无门槛 · 当日有效</view><view class="coupon-tabs"><button wx:for="{{tabs}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" class="{{tab === item.id ? 'selected' : ''}}" bindtap="selectTab">{{item.name}}<text>{{counts[item.id] || 0}}</text></button></view><view class="wallet-list"><view class="wallet-coupon {{item.status !== 'available' ? 'inactive' : ''}}" wx:for="{{coupons}}" wx:key="id"><view class="coupon-value"><text>¥</text>{{item.amount}}</view><view class="coupon-information"><view class="coupon-title">无门槛好物券</view><view class="coupon-source">{{item.source}}</view><view class="coupon-expiry">{{item.dateText}} 23:59:59前有效</view></view><view class="coupon-state">{{item.stateText}}</view><button wx:if="{{item.status === 'available'}}" class="use-coupon" bindtap="shop">去使用 ›</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{!coupons.length}}" class="coupon-empty"><view class="gift-symbol">✧</view><view>{{emptyTitle}}</view><text>{{emptyNote}}</text><button bindtap="shop">去逛商城 ›</button></view><view class="wallet-note">每天限领1张。搜索其他代理关键词不会重复领券，也不会延长有效期。优惠券抵扣独立计算。</view></view>
